{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2961"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_27_1084823968#0_2180522186","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2961","rank":5,"snippet":"\"San Clement Outlets | SanClemente.com San Clemente Outlets Published on June 17, 2019 Shopping and its therapeutic benefits is an intriguing topic, especially in the world of psychology. While ‘therapy’ isn’t the word of the positive effects of shopping, the psychological rewards are undeniably here, and we want more! In 2013, Ebates.com, a leader in online cash back shopping, announced the results of its Retail Therapy survey. They found out that more than 50% of Americans shop to improve their mood. If you’re one of these people who do ‘<cover>retail therapy,’ then doing it at San Clemente Outlets might do your mood justice. Here’s why… Shopping </cover>big brands at Outlets at San Clemente can give you up to 70% off retail. Yes, that’s how they do it here. Come and travel to Orange County. Discover its beauty through its only coastal outlet center brought to you by Craig Realty Group. When did the San Clemente outlets open?\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"San Clement Outlets | SanClemente.com\" , \"url\": \"https://sanclemente.com/san-clemente-outlets/\" }"}}
