{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2961"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_452401969#0_930535754","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2961","rank":7,"snippet":"\" , \"end_char\": 1250.000000 , \"headings\": \"7 Best Malls and Shopping Centers in Colorado Springs 7 Best Malls and Shopping Centers in Colorado Springs The Promenade Shops at Briargate Chapel Hills Mall The Citadel First and Main Town Center Cheyenne Mountain Shopping Center Broadmoor Towne Center University Village Shopping Center About Samantha Ripley \" , \"segment\": \"7 Best Malls & Shopping Centers in Colorado Springs Chapel Hills Mall, Colorado Springs. 7 Best Malls and <cover>Shopping Centers in Colorado Springs October 7, 2019 By // by Samantha Ripley Are you in the mood for a little bit of retail therapy </cover>in the shadow of Pike’s Peak? If you’re looking for some of the widest variety of scenic shopping centers in southern Colorado, you’ll fall in love with the selection in Colorado Springs. Because of the Springs’ unique size and shape, there’s plenty of space for sprawling shopping complexes and malls to continue to grow. Whether you’re closer to the east end of town with a view of the plains or you’re in the heart of downtown, there are dozens of shopping centers "}}
