{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_26_1030490319#2_2025224101","relevance":2,"reason":"The document is about emotional dysregulation and lists shopping among self-detrimental or risky behaviors that can result from extreme or rapidly changing moods. This supports a connection between mood and shopping, but the document is not dedicated to buying behavior and does not specifically explain purchases.","learned":"Emotional dysregulation can lead to impulsive or risky behaviors, including shopping, as a way of responding to intense mood states."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q2977","reason":"The mood-regulation shopping query has surfaced a related psychological mechanism; continuing may retrieve more direct documents about shopping as mood regulation or purchases used to manage mood."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2977"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_26_1024921088#2_2014572434","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2977","rank":2,"snippet":" , \"headings\": \"DBT Emotion Regulation Skills: Emotion Psychoeducation & Mindfulness DBT in Practice: Mastering The Essentials DBT Emotion Regulation Skills: Emotion Psychoeducation & Mindfulness Highlights Transcript More DBT presentations \" , \"segment\": \"The Emotion Regulation module involves psycho-education about emotion, teaches skills to change unwanted emotions and reduce vulnerability to Emotion Mind. Mastery involves taking small action steps toward long-term goals; PLEASE skills refer to self-care activities; Opposite action involves engaging in a behavior opposite to one that is <cover>mood congruent. YouTube Psychotherapy Academy 3.97K subscribers Subscribe DBT Emotion Regulation Skills: Emotion Psychoeducation & Mindfulness Watch later Copy link Info Shopping</cover>Tap to unmute If playback doesn't begin shortly, try restarting your device. You're signed out Videos you watch may be added to the TV's watch history and influence TV recommendations. To avoid this, cancel and sign in to YouTube on your computer. Cancel Confirm More videos More videos Switch camera Share Include playlist An error occurred while retrieving sharing information. Please try again later.\" , \"start_char\": 707.000000 , \"title\": \"DBT Emotion Regulation Skills: Emotion "}}
